     1980                    '  "Элемент:" v_item2 "Результат:" is-marked( v_list, v_item2, ? ) SKIP( 0 )'       + chr(10) +
     1981                    'VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX .'                                                 + chr(10)
     1982         .
     1983       end.
